  "created": "2026-08-07T03:12:06.59Z",
  "description": "Structured concurrency primitives for .NET, mirroring Go's golang.org/x/sync: TaskGroup (errgroup semantics: heterogeneous spawn, first error cancels siblings via a linked token, aggregate at join, SetLimit/TryRun bounded concurrency) and SingleFlight (duplicate-call suppression: concurrent callers with the same key share one in-flight execution with per-caller cancellation and reference-counted flight cancellation, nothing cached after completion). Zero unobserved task exceptions under the pathological usage patterns covered by the suite, proven by hooking TaskScheduler.UnobservedTaskException. Zero external dependencies.",
